ean-like"]],[["தானைப்","army"]],[["பொலந்","golden"]],[["தும்பைக்","tumbai flower"]],[["கழல்","heroic anklet"]],[["பாண்டில்","circular shield"]],[["கணை","arrows"]],[["பொருத","struck"]],[["துளைத்தோலன்னே","is like a shield with holes indeed"]],[["துளைத்தோலன்னே","is like a shield with holes indeed"]],[["ஆயிடை","in that place"]],[["உடன்றோர்","those who opposed"]],[["உய்தல்","escaping"]],[["யாவது","how is it possible"]],[["தடந்தாள்","broad-stemmed"]],[["பிணிக்","tightly packed"]],[["கதிர்","ears of grain"]],[["நெல்லின்","of paddy"]],[["செம்மல்","abundance"]],[["மூதூர்","ancient town"]],[["நுமக்குஉரித்து","belonging to you"]],[["ஆகல்","becoming"]],[["வேண்டின்","if you want"]],[["சென்றவற்கு","to him who approached"]],[["இறுக்கல்","paying"]],[["வேண்டும்","is needed"]],[["திறையே","tribute indeed"]],[["மறிப்பின்","if you refuse"]],[["ஒல்வான்","he who will agree"]],[["அல்லன்","he is not"]],[["வெல்போரான்","he of winning wars"]],[["வெல்போரான்","he of winning wars"]],[["எனச்","thus"]],[["சொல்லவும்","even though told"]],[["தேறீர்","you do not understand"]],[["ஆயின்","if so"]],[["மெல்லியல்","soft-natured"]],[["கழற்","molucca bean"]],[["கனி","fruit"]],[["வகுத்த","divided"]],[["துணைச்","matching"]],[["சில்","few"]],[["ஓதிக்","hair"]],[["குறுந்தொடி","small bangles"]],[["மகளிர்","women"]],[["தோள்விடல்","leaving the shoulders"]],[["இறும்பூது","wonder"]],[["அன்று","it is not"]],[["அஃது","that"]],[["அறிந்து","having known"],["ஆடுமினே","act accordingly!"]],[["ஆடுமினே","act accordingly!"]]]}